 "origin": "issue-2801",
 "quests": {
  "1505-accept": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Krang Stonehoof",
   "npc": "3063",
   "questID": 1505,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The Horde honors its warriors because their strength is unquestioned.  But the truly great warriors are great students as well.\n\nSeek out Uzzek.  He is a veteran of many battles and now instructs young warriors in the ways of combat.  You will find him south of Far Watch Post, the orc garrison on the border of the Barrens and Durotar to the east.",
   "time": 1793854902,
   "title": "Veteran Uzzek",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "95805-complete": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "complete",
   "isObject": true,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Unknown",
   "npc": "-660739",
   "questID": 95805,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<As you empty the incense into the fire, the scent wafts around you, leaving you with just the empty pouch and a subtle sense of fulfillment.>",
   "time": 1793841067,
   "title": "Grace of An'she and Mu'sha",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "95805-progress": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": true,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Unknown",
   "npc": "-660739",
   "questID": 95805,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<The smoke from the incense rises toward the sky.>",
   "time": 1793841065,
   "title": "Grace of An'she and Mu'sha",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "96652-accept": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": true,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Unknown",
   "npc": "-654925",
   "questID": 96652,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<The journal appears to be quite plain, detailing the life and adventures of someone you've never heard of.\r\n\r\nThere are multiple entries mentioning camping. It seems to be quite... fun.>",
   "time": 1793838917,
   "title": "The Adventurer",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "96873-accept": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warlock",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Pa'zula",
   "npc": "266881",
   "questID": 96873,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The trolls east of here have lost their will to the witchdoctor, Zalazane. He uses many cruel magics to keep hold of his prisoners' minds, but one of his favorite tricks is to make them wear pendants wrapped in evil binding spells.\r\n\r\nPractice your enchanting skills by stripping the magic from these pendants, and bring me the results. And don't accidentally put one around your neck, if you value your freedom!",
   "time": 1793867890,
   "title": "A Pain in the Neck",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "97933-accept": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Kaga Wildhoof",
   "npc": "265810",
   "questID": 97933,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Looks to me like you've gained some skill in herbalism. Picking flowers isn't just for dilly-dallying, you know. It can be useful... and profitable.\r\n\r\nI reckon I know someone that can teach you how to craft an Incense Candle for your camp. High spirits are a key component to keeping healers and spellcasters in the fight, and an Incense Candle can provide a boost that magic users will surely appreciate.",
   "time": 1793843690,
   "title": "Camping 101: Herbalism",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "98424-accept": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": true,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Unknown",
   "npc": null,
   "questID": 98424,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Some particularly worn papers are held separately, folded in Fizsprocket's inside breast pocket.\r\n\r\nThey seem to detail important information that could be used against the Venture Co. and its operations in the region. It would be prudent to look for more before returning to Morin Cloudstalker.",
   "time": 1793856188,
   "title": "Fizsprocket's Notes",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "98424-complete": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "complete",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Morin Cloudstalker",
   "npc": "2988",
   "questID": 98424,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Ah, this is most valuable knowledge. I thank you for your efforts.\r\n\r\n<Morin looks through the notes.>\r\n\r\nIt seems our next move is clear.",
   "time": 1793857153,
   "title": "Fizsprocket's Notes",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "98424-progress": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
